        "@value": "Tuesday Jam Hosted by Ultimate Goodbye - The Yardbird Suite"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Zane, Sean, and Keaton met at MacEwan University and have since fostered their love of jazz and improvised music through semi-regular jam sessions in a squeaky-floored living room in Mill Creek."
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
