      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "With a classical and jazz background, guitarist Samuel Bonnet's music is at the crossroads of several musical universes, somewhere between the natural resonance of classical guitar’s nylon strings and jazz improvisation."
      }
    ],
