        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where rhythm meets rebellion, emerges Funk the Matriarchy – the soul-stirring band on a mission to amplify the voices of women in funk, soul, and R&amp;B. Funk the Matriarchy is the perfect band to help us celebrate International Women's Day!"
