      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Singer, pianist, and composer Lorna MacLachlan began her career as a composer providing award winning original music for theatre, dance and national media companies such as CBC and Access as well as a variety of commercial and artistic enterprises across the spectrum of music genres."
      }
