      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Long-time Edmonton blues and roots music fans have a special two-night engagement on May 16 and 17 coming at them in the form of a reunion of a band that at one time was part of the cream of the crop on the western Canadian music scene almost five decades ago."
      }
